            "original_audio_sha256": "a1942662f19a288c80ce936418669c3c8d88aa6a89b48a7d1b6d8d836f9e3795",
            "reference": "Over time, as the new population begins to adapt to their new environment, they start to look less and less like the other population.",
            "translation_reference": "Al pasar el tiempo, a medida que la incipiente población se va adaptando al nuevo entorno, comienza a asemejarse cada vez menos a la otra población.",
            "padding_after_samples": 16000
          },
          {
            "id": "fleurs-en-development-1603-561237249582086895",
            "sample_start": 195520,
            "sample_end": 391360,
            "original_audio_sha256": "68a7e4554855ad270fc02d113e51267c64515000913f52f0439f6b21e06802a6",
            "reference": "Air accidents are common in Iran, which has an aging fleet that is poorly maintained both for civil and military operations.",
            "translation_reference": "Los accidentes de avión son habituales en Irán, que tiene una flota antigua que no recibe buen mantenimiento, ya sea para operaciones civiles o militares.",
            "padding_after_samples": 16000
          },
          {
            "id": "fleurs-en-development-1519-786465049904960526",
            "sample_start": 407360,
            "sample_end": 532160,
            "original_audio_sha256": "d733a878fbb3393dac0349cfa1293e4fad9a8bd5ec1f58ce6adc019de4b94f32",
            "reference": "In many cases, enrolling on a gap-year course abroad can actually improve your chances of moving into higher education back in your home country.",
            "translation_reference": "En muchos casos, inscribirse en un programa de estudios en el extranjero durante un año sabático puede, en efecto, incrementar las posibilidades de acceder a la educación superior una vez se regresa al país de origen.",
            "padding_after_samples": 16000
          },
          {
            "id": "fleurs-en-development-1571-17605417583330616175",
            "sample_start": 548160,
            "sample_end": 657600,
            "original_audio_sha256": "417fee0dad20562352aa591b6ed5b1f10752eba60ef2d9f95389e8ba34272191",
            "reference": "The Arabs also brought Islam to the lands, and it took in a big way in the Comoros and Mayotte.",
            "translation_reference": "El islam también fue llevado a las tierras por los árabes y se impuso, en buena medida, en las Comores y Mayotte.",
            "padding_after_samples": 16000
          },
          {
            "id": "fleurs-en-development-1607-10846227846460802233",
            "sample_start": 673600,
            "sample_end": 735040,
            "original_audio_sha256": "cd18277b92bd22d1c2827f6bee287a636cc227365fd9bc1d7e3ef5b81afe6ad3",
            "reference": "It's worth half an hour to stroll about the intriguing village.",
            "translation_reference": "Merece la pena dedicar media hora a dar un paseo por el fascinante pueblo.",
            "padding_after_samples": 16000
          }
